### LibraryLoans API - requisições de exemplo
### Use com a extensão "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) ou com o suporte a .http do VS Code/Visual Studio/Rider.
### Pré-requisito: docker compose up --build -d   (API em http://localhost:8080)
### Execute de cima para baixo: cada resposta nomeada alimenta as requisições seguintes.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@isbn = 9780132350884

############################################################
# Health checks
############################################################

### Liveness: só confirma que o processo responde (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: PostgreSQL (obrigatório) e Redis (200 Healthy/Degraded, 503 Unhealthy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

############################################################
# Catálogo de livros
############################################################

### Criar livro (201)
# @name createBook
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-create-book

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "{{isbn}}",
  "totalCopies": 1
}

###
@bookId = {{createBook.response.body.$.id}}

### Criar livro com ISBN duplicado (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Outro título",
  "author": "Outro autor",
  "isbn": "{{isbn}}",
  "totalCopies": 1
}

### Criar livro inválido (400, Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "",
  "isbn": "123",
  "totalCopies": -1
}

### Listar livros com paginação e busca (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?page=1&pageSize=10&search=Clean

### Listar incluindo desativados
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?includeInactive=true

### Consultar livro (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}

### Consultar livro inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Atualizar livro (200). AvailableCopies não pode ser alterado diretamente
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code (2ª edição)"
}

### Tentar alterar AvailableCopies (400: campo não aceito)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "availableCopies": 99
}

### Disponibilidade (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/availability

############################################################
# Leitores
############################################################

### Cadastrar leitor (201)
# @name createReader
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana"
}

###
@readerId = {{createReader.response.body.$.id}}

### Cadastrar segundo leitor (201)
# @name createReader2
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Beto"
}

###
@reader2Id = {{createReader2.response.body.$.id}}

############################################################
# Empréstimos (POST /loans exige Idempotency-Key)
############################################################

### Criar empréstimo (201)
# @name createLoan
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-loan-key-0001

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "readerId": "{{readerId}}"
}

###
@loanId = {{createLoan.response.body.$.id}}

### Repetir a mesma chave e payload (201 com header Idempotent-Replayed: true; sem novo empréstimo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-loan-key-0001

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "readerId": "{{readerId}}"
}

### Mesma chave com payload diferente (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-loan-key-0001

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "readerId": "{{reader2Id}}"
}

### Sem Idempotency-Key (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "readerId": "{{readerId}}"
}

### Livro sem exemplares disponíveis, com chave nova (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-loan-key-0002

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "readerId": "{{reader2Id}}"
}

### Disponibilidade depois do empréstimo
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/availability

### Devolver empréstimo (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/return

### Devolver de novo (409: transição inválida; estoque não é incrementado outra vez)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loanId}}/return

### Empréstimo inexistente (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/return

### Criar outro empréstimo para cancelar (201)
# @name createLoan2
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-loan-key-0003

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "readerId": "{{reader2Id}}"
}

###
@loan2Id = {{createLoan2.response.body.$.id}}

### Cancelar empréstimo (200; o registro é preservado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/{{loan2Id}}/cancel

############################################################
# Histórico
############################################################

### Histórico de empréstimos do livro (ativos, devolvidos e cancelados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/history?page=1&pageSize=20

### Histórico do livro filtrado por status (Active, Returned, Cancelled)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/history?status=Returned

### Histórico de empréstimos do leitor
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{readerId}}/loans?page=1&pageSize=20

### Histórico de leitor inexistente (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/loans

############################################################
# Auditoria (somente leitura)
############################################################

### Todos os eventos, paginados
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-events?page=1&pageSize=20

### Eventos de um empréstimo
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-events?entityType=Loan&entityId={{loanId}}

### Eventos por ação
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-events?action=LoanReturned

### Eventos por correlationId (veja o X-Correlation-Id enviado em "Criar livro")
GET {{baseUrl}}/audit-events?correlationId=demo-create-book

############################################################
# Desativação de livro (nunca apaga fisicamente)
############################################################

### Desativar livro (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}

### Empréstimo de livro desativado (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-loan-key-0004

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "readerId": "{{readerId}}"
}

### O livro e seu histórico continuam consultáveis
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}/history
